(1, 2, 'HK 35KG висок въртящ момент безчеткови цифрови изцяло метални зъбни колела CNC алуминиева средна обвивка Голям мащаб серво (HK5535MG) за 1/5 1/6 1/8 мащаб RC Crawler Axial Capra Plane Robot Arm', 'hk-35kg-high-torque-brushless-digital-full-metal-gear-cnc-aluminum-middle-shell-large-scale-servo-hk5535mg-for-15-16-18-scale-rc-crawler-axial-capra-plane-robot-arm', 'Безчетково цифрово серво с висок въртящ момент от 35 kg с изцяло алуминиева средна обвивка с ЦПУ. Идеален за пълзящи машини с мащаб 1/5-1/8, самолети и роботизирани ръце, изискващи прецизен контрол.', 30.99, NULL, NULL, 10, 'https://cdn-global-hk.hobbyking.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/180x100/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/k/hk_35kg_high_torque_brushless_digital_full_metal_gear_cnc_aluminum_middle_shell_large_scale_servo_hk5535mg_for_15_scale_16_scale_18_scale_rc_crawler_axial_capra_plane_robot_arm_1_.jpg', 'https://cdn-global-hk.hobbyking.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/180x100/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/k/hk_35kg_high_torque_brushless_digital_full_metal_gear_cnc_aluminum_middle_shell_large_scale_servo_hk5535mg_for_15_scale_16_scale_18_scale_rc_crawler_axial_capra_plane_robot_arm_2_.jpg', 'https://cdn-global-hk.hobbyking.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/180x100/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/k/hk_35kg_high_torque_brushless_digital_full_metal_gear_cnc_aluminum_middle_shell_large_scale_servo_hk5535mg_for_15_scale_16_scale_18_scale_rc_crawler_axial_capra_plane_robot_arm_3_.jpg', 'https://cdn-global-hk.hobbyking.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/180x100/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/k/hk_35kg_high_torque_brushless_digital_full_metal_gear_cnc_aluminum_middle_shell_large_scale_servo_hk5535mg_for_15_scale_16_scale_18_scale_rc_crawler_axial_capra_plane_robot_arm_4_.jpg', NULL, 1, '2026-02-07 19:54:07'),
