(81, 6, 'Aerostar 20A RVS G2 32-битов (2~4S) електронен регулатор на скоростта с функция за заден ход и 4A 5~6V SBEC', 'aerostar-20a-rvs-g2-32bit-24s-electronic-speed-controller-wreverse-function-4a-56v-sbec', '20 A 2-4S реверсивен безчетков ESC с 32-битов процесор. Включва 4 A 5-6V SBEC. Двупосочна функция за заден ход за лодки и краулери.', 24.99, NULL, NULL, 37, 'https://cdn-global-hk.hobbyking.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/180x100/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/0/20a-9164000048-0-1.jpg', 'https://cdn-global-hk.hobbyking.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/180x100/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/0/20a-9164000048-0-2.jpg', 'https://cdn-global-hk.hobbyking.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/180x100/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/0/20a-9164000048-0-3.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-yI5e-xJe0', 1, '2026-02-07 19:54:07'),
